  m_text: '- Move with arrow keys.


    - Draft new tiles by moving into an empty
    space.


    -Press "R" while drafting to rotate a tile. Then "ENTER" to place
    it.


    - Collect      to activate special rooms.


    - Press "F" to activate
    rooms.


    - Press "Q" to use a Reroll.


    - Press "H" while drafting to
    use a Hold.


    - Press "P" to restart.'
